<title>CHILE: RESEARCH ALERT - Provida upgraded to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Provida upgraded to buy.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>ING Barings upgraded Chilean pension fund administrator Provida SA to buy from hold.</p>
<p>Analyst Ricardo Fernandez said Provida had hit bottom in terms of its stock price and financial performance.</p>
<p>Fee income grew by 3.6 percent in first quarter 1997 on the same quarter of 1996 on the back of a 3.3 percent in active affiliates, said the report.</p>
<p>((--Roger Atwood, Santiago newsroom +56-2-699-5595 x211))</p>
</text>
